        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "As a local real estate broker, I have had the pleasure of working with Guillaume on several projects. I must say that his service and knowledge as a mortgage broker are absolutely incredible. Guillaume is a knowledgeable and dedicated professional who always strives to provide his clients with the best possible mortgage options. He is also very attentive to detail and takes the time to answer all questions clearly and precisely. If you are looking for a reliable and knowledgeable mortgage broker, I highly recommend Guillaume. His expertise and professionalism are truly remarkable.",
        "time": 1678392710,
        "translated": true
      },
